<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="sw">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>Jisajili — Mnunuzi — Soko la Mtandaoni</title>
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/public/img/icon-32.png">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/css/style.css">
</head>
<body>
<div class="auth-shell">
  <div class="auth-box">
    <a href="/" class="brand"><img src="/public/img/logo.png" alt=""><span>Soko la Mtandaoni</span></a>
    <h1 style="text-align:center; font-size:24px; margin-bottom:6px;">Jisajili kama Mnunuzi</h1>
    <p style="text-align:center; margin:0 auto 24px;">Kununua kwa kuwasiliana na muuzaji hakuhitaji usajili. Lakini kuomba usafirishaji wa Public/Protected, na kufuatilia historia yako, unahitaji akaunti kamili.</p>

    <% if (flashError) { %><div class="alert alert-error"><%= flashError %></div><% } %>
    <% if (flashSuccess) { %><div class="alert alert-success"><%= flashSuccess %></div><% } %>

    <div class="form-card">
      <form action="/jisajili/mnunuzi" method="POST">
        <div class="field">
          <label>Jina Kamili *</label>
          <input type="text" name="jina" required value="<%= formData.jina || '' %>" class="<%= missingFields.includes('jina') ? 'input-invalid' : '' %>">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Namba ya Simu *</label>
          <input type="tel" name="simu" required value="<%= formData.simu || '' %>" class="<%= missingFields.includes('simu') ? 'input-invalid' : '' %>" placeholder="07XXXXXXXX">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Barua Pepe *</label>
          <input type="email" name="email" required value="<%= formData.email || '' %>" class="<%= missingFields.includes('email') ? 'input-invalid' : '' %>">
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Anwani (kwa ajili ya usafirishaji) *</label>
          <input type="text" name="anwani" required value="<%= formData.anwani || '' %>" data-google-map-input class="<%= missingFields.includes('anwani') ? 'input-invalid' : '' %>" placeholder="Mtaa, Mji">
          <a class="btn btn-outline btn-sm google-map-link" data-google-map-link target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" <%= formData.anwani ? '' : 'hidden' %>>Fungua anwani kwenye Google Maps</a>
        </div>
        <div class="field">
          <label>Password *</label>
          <div class="password-control"><input type="password" name="password" required minlength="6" autocomplete="new-password" class="<%= missingFields.includes('password') ? 'input-invalid' : '' %>"><button type="button" class="btn btn-ghost btn-sm" data-password-toggle aria-label="Onyesha password">Onyesha</button></div>
        </div>
        <p class="hint" style="margin-bottom:14px;">Taarifa zote ni za lazima ili uweze kuomba usafirishaji wa Public/Protected na kuunganishwa na msafirishaji kwa usalama.</p>
        <button type="submit" class="btn btn-accent btn-block">Jisajili</button>
      </form>
    </div>
    <p class="center-note">Tayari una akaunti? <a href="/ingia?aina=mnunuzi">Ingia hapa</a></p>
  </div>
</div>
<script src="/public/js/forms.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
